HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,i],flag=array[*,3,i].  The zeroth image           HISTORY (array[*,*,0]) contains the data for the aperture in the order          HISTORY closest to the bottom of the detector that is closest to the            HISTORY bottom of the slit (i.e. also closest to the bottom of the              HISTORY detector).  Moving up the detector, the FITS array is filled in         HISTORY with subsequent extraction apertures.  If no orders have been           HISTORY deselected in the extraction process, the contents of the ith           HISTORY aperture in order j can be found as follows:                            HISTORY lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                         HISTORY flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                           HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                    HISTORY flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].                           HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The spectra in the file(s) spectra0277.fits, spectra0278.fits,          HISTORY spectra0279.fits, spectra0280.fits, spectra0281.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0282.fits, spectra0283.fits, spectra0284.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0285.fits, spectra0286.fits, spectra0287.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0288.fits, spectra0289.fits, spectra0290.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0291.fits, spectra0292.fits, spectra0293.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0294.fits, spectra0295.fits, spectra0296.fits were               HISTORY combined using a robust weighted mean with a sigma threshold of         HISTORY 8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The scale factors were determined         HISTORY using order 5 and are: 1.1084654093594377, 1.2322273878532837,          HISTORY 0.9518069683817416, 1.0029830782437614, 0.8913251634658007,             HISTORY 0.8678118487108775, 1.0308758836355658, 0.9970346137148618,             